Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) does not cross the BBB (B) crosses the BBB
Drug SMILES: CN(C)[C@@H]1C(=O)/C(=C(/O)NCNC(C(=O)NC2C(=O)N3C2SC(C)(C)C3C(=O)O)c2ccccc2)C(=O)[C@@]2(O)C(=O)C3=C(O)c4c(O)cccc4[C@@](C)(O)[C@H]3C[C@@H]12
