Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) is not toxic (B) is toxic
Drug SMILES: C[C@]12CC[C@@H]3c4ccc(O)cc4C[C@@H](CCCCCCCCCS(=O)CCCC(F)(F)C(F)(F)F)[C@H]3[C@@H]1CC[C@@H]2O
