Question: Given a drug SMILES string, predict whether it
(A) is not toxic (B) is toxic
Drug SMILES: COCC1=C(C(=O)OC(C)OC(=O)OC(C)C)N2C(=O)[C@@H](NC(=O)/C(=N\OC)c3csc(N)n3)[C@H]2SC1
